    "bbox": [
      49.94,
      253.51,
      550.85,
      321.58
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at several places in the sea areas off the coast extending from Chilaw to Hambantota via Colombo and Galle. Winds: Winds will be westerly to south-westerly. Wind speed will be (30-40) kmph.",
    "fonts": [
