      1.9199999570846558,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      49.94,
      362.56,
      550.85,
      467.78
    ],
    "text": "Wind speed can increase up to 50 kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Batticaloa to Chilaw via Trincomalee, Kankasanthurai and Mannar, and from Galle to Matara. State of Sea: The sea areas off the coasts extending from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota will be rough or very rough at times. Naval and fishing communities are advised not to venture into these sea areas, until further notice.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Bold",
