      542.18
    ],
    "text": "The sea areas off the coasts extending from Batticaloa to Chilaw via Trincomalee, Kankasanthurai, Mannar, and from Galle to Matara will be rough at times. The naval and fishing communities who are engaged in fishing and naval activities in the above sea areas are requested to be vigilant in this regard.",
